 "notes": "Own-row 'circular reservoir' not said to be roofed, so pool yes. Crypts (S2709, S2990) coded as pits (underground chambers), not graves, as the source does not call them burials. SWP: Mem III p. 104 'Khurbet Abu I\\I aseirah' (OCR-garbled, apparently this unit) says only 'Ruined walls'. Ignored as different places not within 2 km: Khurbet Umm esh Sherit (Ms, 7.5 km, different name although linked in Stage 1b), Khurbet el Meshrab with the following Khurbet Mird text, Umm Sirah, Khurbet Umm el 'Asafir (11-13 km). E398 bearing invalid. First publication not accessed."
}